<title>USA: Boca Research says cuts temporary workforce.</title>
<headline>Boca Research says cuts temporary workforce.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fl. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boca Research Inc said Thursday it cut its temporary workforce by 20 percent in order to cut expenses.</p>
<p>The company said it uses agency personnel to supplement its manufacturing workforce.</p>
<p>The company reported first quarter operating expenses of $5.37 million compared to $5.44 million for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>The company reported a loss per share of $0.38 compared to a profit of $0.29 for the same period a year ago.</p>
</text>
